    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "377342e6-f21a-3f84-8795-a333b04ec719",
                "word": "incel",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "129876ac-461f-3f8d-a4e7-2f8cec0f097b",
                        "entry_id": "377342e6-f21a-3f84-8795-a333b04ec719",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Not having sexual relations despite wishing to."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "66b890ea-a7ce-4197-8a07-42d69806bfd2",
                                "sense_id": "129876ac-461f-3f8d-a4e7-2f8cec0f097b",
                                "text": "People who are 'incel' are often suspected as being gay. It's annoying."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "759ad76a-3292-3cb0-90fe-409eeccaa53f",
                "word": "incel",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "8019bd5e-6db7-4e41-b2af-203a78c611e6",
                        "entry_id": "759ad76a-3292-3cb0-90fe-409eeccaa53f",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "incels"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c100ff16-451b-35d4-9e7e-573fa08861e1",
                        "entry_id": "759ad76a-3292-3cb0-90fe-409eeccaa53f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A member of an online subculture of people (mostly men) who define themselves as unable to find a romantic or sexual partner despite desiring one."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7f4bc5c3-ad11-4b9d-8a13-248e475b8520",
                                "sense_id": "c100ff16-451b-35d4-9e7e-573fa08861e1",
                                "text": "Though, involuntary celibates (or incels) shouldn't try to rationalize a dateless season or pass off sexual awkwardness as virtue; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "99608605-4c66-493d-9d91-1675ea83a75e",
                                "sense_id": "c100ff16-451b-35d4-9e7e-573fa08861e1",
                                "text": "It is not clear when the term incels was coined, but the link between misogyny and violence against women has emerged on sites where incel communities gather."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b6123ac6-e382-48f3-a434-6b15e3a975ed",
                                "sense_id": "c100ff16-451b-35d4-9e7e-573fa08861e1",
                                "text": "The incel ideology has already inspired the murders of at least sixteen people. Elliot Rodger, in 2014, in Isla Vista, California, killed six and injured fourteen in an attempt to instigate a “War on Women” for “depriving me of sex.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "be289dfe-24d9-4c95-b2bf-1c22d4920c86",
                                "sense_id": "c100ff16-451b-35d4-9e7e-573fa08861e1",
                                "text": "The framing of inceldom as an “adverse life circumstance”, repeated across the Wiki, lends credibility to the framing used by incels who wish to dissociate themselves from the common descriptions of incels as a ‘movement’, ‘ideology’ or ‘community’. […] This report finds that the Wiki is a site of attempts to divorce the concept of being an incel from believing in the blackpill, and we argue that this is intended as a means of both expanding the category of incels to make them politically relevant, and dissociating the label ‘incel’ from violent misogyny."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9c9332cf-0b3b-45b9-8b59-0a12971ff47a",
                                "sense_id": "c100ff16-451b-35d4-9e7e-573fa08861e1",
                                "text": "Online forums dedicated to incel culture are a reliable way to see how the term evolved and is used today. A subreddit, or forum on Reddit, called r/incels was one of the most visible meeting places for self-identified incels until it was banned by Reddit in 2017 for “violent content.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c0a9b9e3-84e8-34dd-95af-00df5788ed2b",
                        "entry_id": "759ad76a-3292-3cb0-90fe-409eeccaa53f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An individual who is not sexually active despite having such a desire."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "rare",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e46aa6d9-b7ba-4ab5-ad54-409327982ea4",
                                "sense_id": "c0a9b9e3-84e8-34dd-95af-00df5788ed2b",
                                "text": "Another study by Donnelly of seventy-seven incels in marriages or long-term relationships in the Journal of Marriage and Family used a web-based questionnaire to ask people why they stayed in their sexless relationships (defined in this case as no sex for six months)."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e239547d-4ab7-307d-a8e1-d5e6f9b4cc2f",
                        "entry_id": "759ad76a-3292-3cb0-90fe-409eeccaa53f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A misogynistic man, with the implication that his misogyny makes him undesirable to potential partners, thus limiting his romantic and/or sexual prospects."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "derogatory",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9884c91b-5baf-3f23-8f4e-e3b5ba7cd276",
                        "entry_id": "759ad76a-3292-3cb0-90fe-409eeccaa53f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "\\\"Involuntary celibacy\\\": the state of being not sexually active despite wishing to be."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d114d1ed-d3b2-41b6-a985-6372ac5f2917",
                        "source_entry_id": "759ad76a-3292-3cb0-90fe-409eeccaa53f",
                        "source_sense_description": "member of an online subculture unable to find a romantic or sexual partner",
                        "target_lang_word": "incel",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "incel",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9b3ddf67-ef80-3a66-8b10-1fe23d3f09c4",
                                        "entry_id": "9fc1344b-3f4c-3dfc-bd55-7f18cd33581c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "man die onvoldoende of nooit seks heeft ondanks dit wel te willen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae6ebd0c-d0f1-48a0-a27e-78d54fde8d40",
                                                "sense_id": "9b3ddf67-ef80-3a66-8b10-1fe23d3f09c4",
                                                "text": "De incels vinden dat de samenleving onaantrekkelijke, heteroseksuele mannen tekortdoet en hebben een hartgrondige hekel aan vrouwen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c3bf78f6-11b3-4a02-86ad-7200386cbb98",
                                                "sense_id": "9b3ddf67-ef80-3a66-8b10-1fe23d3f09c4",
                                                "text": "Mannen die zichzelf identificeren als incels „kunnen geen seks krijgen, hoewel ze dat wel willen”, wordt uitgelegd op de website incels.me, een van de belangrijkste internetforums van de beweging, naast 4chan en Reddit."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac90497b-288d-4622-a663-c322a531baa3",
                                                "sense_id": "9b3ddf67-ef80-3a66-8b10-1fe23d3f09c4",
                                                "text": "Sommigen dromen over een opstand waarin de incels seks met geweld afdwingen, anderen fantaseren eerder over massale schietpartijen als vergelding."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "39c31e9b-72a8-4cfb-9bed-5e5dcf648b09",
                        "source_entry_id": "759ad76a-3292-3cb0-90fe-409eeccaa53f",
                        "source_sense_description": "member of an online subculture unable to find a romantic or sexual partner",
                        "target_lang_word": "incel",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "incel",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9434f635-257e-326f-b03b-79bdb883817b",
                                        "entry_id": "da078e82-4926-3644-86d1-7ff78334fd5d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Culture des communautés en ligne dont les membres se définissent comme étant incapables de trouver un(e) partenaire amoureux(se) ou sexuel(le)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Anglicism",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6a4c0f40-4c41-3261-9da8-37f8a24324cd",
                                        "entry_id": "da078e82-4926-3644-86d1-7ff78334fd5d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Homme célibataire malgré le désir d’être en couple qui éprouve de l’aigreur vis-à-vis des femmes en raison de son insuccès auprès d’elles, pouvant aller jusqu’à la justification et la perpétration de féminicides de masse par une petite partie d’entre-eux."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Anglicism",
                                            "especially",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cef3dbeb-d7ed-499e-a848-1a6aa1ebdb28",
                                                "sense_id": "6a4c0f40-4c41-3261-9da8-37f8a24324cd",
                                                "text": "Le mot « incel » désigne les hommes « célibataires involontaires » – ces indésirables autoproclamés du marché de la séduction, dont l’idéologie consiste à accuser les femmes de tous leurs malheurs (« si elles ne veulent pas coucher avec moi, c’est bien qu’elles sont méchantes »). Avec les « incels », nous avons affaire à des masculinistes, attachés à une idée très étroite de la virilité."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8f5f6a73-5516-41e7-91cd-866e8d869011",
                                                "sense_id": "6a4c0f40-4c41-3261-9da8-37f8a24324cd",
                                                "text": "Il savait qu'une partie de ses lecteurs étaient des incels, c'est-à-dire, selon son témoignage, \"des jeunes hommes frustrés de moins de 25 ans qui ont de la misère avec les filles\", énonce le jugement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5512da3-7f37-4faf-9fd5-c37b1f1d731d",
                                                "sense_id": "6a4c0f40-4c41-3261-9da8-37f8a24324cd",
                                                "text": "Les incels, ces « célibataires involontaires », vivent aussi dans leur bulle numérique, hyper-misogyne celle-là."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7d4c778f-f906-4e1c-83aa-88845f286f7a",
                                                "sense_id": "6a4c0f40-4c41-3261-9da8-37f8a24324cd",
                                                "text": "Si une grande partie des Incels sont fatalistes, d’autres tentent de changer leur situation en menant des actions concrètes. La Chaire a d’ailleurs développé un partenariat avec le Centre de prévention de la radicalisation menant à la violence afin de mieux comprendre les hommes qui souhaiteraient rompre avec l’idéologie d’Inceldom."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e21831a-9e78-4907-a4bb-b48bd7e551e1",
                                                "sense_id": "6a4c0f40-4c41-3261-9da8-37f8a24324cd",
                                                "text": "L’opposition entre un soutien a priori affiché à la cause et une dénonciation de l’extrémisme supposé de ses manifestations concrètes, qui viendrait la desservir et même la dénaturer, est un double discours récurrent des stratégies de disqualification des revendications féministes. Idem pour les accusations d’« inquisition », de « lynchage », de « vengeance » et de « dictature », qu’on retrouve aussi bien dans les discours antiféministes mainstream que dans les discours masculinistes explicitement misogynes et violents de la droite extrême et des incels."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "05034693-524e-47e3-90e3-7d1bd1839c54",
